WEBVTT

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:10.030
You've all treated me very well.

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:13.280
When I first arrived in the demon realm, 
I was full of anxiety,

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.980
but you made me feel very welcome.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.530
I'm truly grateful.

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:20.790
M-Mio-sama?

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:25.650
But I've decided to live my life from here on as a human.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:26.580
Therefore...

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.460
I don't intend on succeeding my father.

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:32.460
Thank you for your kindness.

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:20.950
Here you go.

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.380
Thank you.

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:26.450
In regard to extracting the Demon Lord's power from Mio-sama...

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.380
Call it off.

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:31.000
Are you sure?

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:33.690
Circumstances have changed.

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:35.320
We must.

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:35.900
Yes.

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:38.540
Are you really sure?

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:38.900
Yeah.

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:40.300
Hey, Basara.

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:42.610
Dad?!

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:48.230
You been doing well?

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:54.230
Dimensional fluctuation?

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:56.530
What do you mean, Gald?

00:02:58.090 --> 00:02:59.530
It's a technique.

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:04.050
He can direct the dimensional fluctuation that occurs{that causes a dimensional fluctuation when Brynhildr appears,}

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:06.130
when Brynhildr is called forth.{which is fired as a shockwave.}

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:09.540
It's a supersonic slash, that cuts like a whirlwind.{It's like a supersonic slash, 
like the lacerations of a whirlwind.}

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:13.250
It caught me by surprise.

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:15.340
I see.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:17.440
I'm sorry, Leohart.

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:19.620
And I even volunteered to lead...

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.260
No, you truly did well.

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:28.270
For now, get some rest and heal your wounds.

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:40.070
<i>I can't believe Gald was defeated.</i>

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:43.610
<i>Naruse Mio shattered that heroic spirit.</i>

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:47.980
<i>Ramsus presented a glimpse of
 his true power for the first time.</i>

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.330
<i>And Gald was forced to retreat...</i>

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.540
<i>by that son of Jin Toujou.</i>

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:02.010
Leo-kun!

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:03.430
Elder Sister!

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:04.260
What's the matter?

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.260
You look terrifying.

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:09.260
Did something unpleasant happen?

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:10.370
No.

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:13.670
You can't hide it from me.

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:16.580
Liala-oneechan{Your big sister Liala} sees through everything!

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:19.770
I can't win against you, can I, Elder Sister?

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.580
Then let's do the usual tonight.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:41.250
Don't worry. You're a splendid Demon Lord, Leo-kun.

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:43.350
You won't ever lose.

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:45.760
After all, Onee-chan{your big sister}'s on your side.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:51.260
I'll take care of any bad people who try to get in our way!

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.770
Whoa!

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:05.500
I tripped!

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:10.280
That was rather extravagant.

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:15.290
Scary, scary.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:19.290
The form of the competition will be
 a seven against seven match of representatives.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:21.950
Whichever camp seizes the most victories

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:24.300
will obtain authority over the demon realm.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:28.740
Thus it has been decreed under the
 name of the Demon Lord, Leohart.

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:34.810
So, what do you plan to do, Ram-chan?

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:37.860
Well, there's no doubt it's a trap.

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:39.990
At the very least, the folks on the council

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:44.320
wouldn't allow these conditions without some kind of ploy.

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:46.130
True.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:50.320
It's unsettling that it doesn't touch at all on the victor's prize.

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:54.290
The victor's reward is obviously Mio-chan.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:58.830
And the head of whoever loses gets the axe.

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:02.340
Still, it's a lot better than waging full-scale war.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:06.510
Just imagine if that heroic spirit showed up with a large army at its back.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:08.720
The damage would be a lot worse than this.

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:12.180
We have no choice but to accept.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:16.730
Still, things never do go quite as planned, do they?

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:20.290
The new Demon Lord, Leohart, being a man of such caliber,

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:24.230
and you calling Mio-chan here to the demon 
realm were both miscalculations, weren't they?

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:25.630
Indeed.

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:29.510
I thought the council would select a Demon Lord that was more easily manipulated,

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:31.110
but I was naïve.

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:35.690
By the way, I went to our rendezvous point when things went down,

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:37.800
but <i>she</i> was nowhere to be found.

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:40.600
Were there any changes in plans on your end, as well?

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:44.090
No, even I don't have a grasp on her whereabouts.

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:46.380
Hey, hey, seriously?

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:52.140
Actually, Safia-chan doesn't seem to be in the demon realm at all, you know.

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:53.860
Mother!

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:54.890
You can tell?

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:59.070
Hmm, well, you could say it's a woman's intuition.

00:06:59.070 --> 00:07:02.170
Your intuition's usually on target, too.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:07.700
Well, for now, let's clear out the
 problems that are right before us.

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:16.910
So, how do you plan on fighting this competition?

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:18.650
There's no question about it.

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:21.410
I can't very well leave it up to those children.

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:23.440
Hold on there, Ram-chan.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:25.920
I know Leohart was unexpected,

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.210
but if we head out ourselves,

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.920
the entire plan could be ruined.

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:35.870
Basara...

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:36.680
I'm sorry.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.110
I...

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:46.190
I'll relieve you right now.

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:53.310
Fortunately, we still have some time before the competition.

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:56.200
I'll do everything I can to train them up

00:07:56.810 --> 00:08:00.200
till the final moment before we have to head out.

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:05.210
I'll teach them everything they need to know to come out victorious.

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:08.900
O-Onii-chan!

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:17.140
You can put your decision off until you see that through, right?

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:46.000
Damn it!

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:52.010
Come on. If you can still keep it up, then come at me.

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:01.720
Hey, hey.

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:11.860
It's hard enough to dodge attacks in mid-air.

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:16.360
So what are you doing challenging a power-type head on?

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:14.860
Not yet!

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:23.420
You're swinging that wide after I <i>just</i> told you not to?

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:32.870
That one wasn't bad, but

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:35.180
if you want to hit your target for certain,

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:38.380
you need to break your opponent's guard with your feint.

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:40.140
Otherwise,

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:52.150
you end up like this.

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:54.430
Can you keep going?

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:57.260
Of course!

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:58.310
I see.

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:00.450
Then we'll resume after a short break.

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:09.250
Hey, Dad.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.170
Hmm?

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:14.980
You've met the current Demon Lord, Leohart, right?

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:18.780
Yeah. He seemed young, but he was quite good.

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:23.560
Do you think I stand a chance of beating him as I am now?

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:25.470
Let's see.

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:31.980
Well, if you fight him head-on, 
he might be stronger than me.

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:35.080
You couldn't beat him either?!

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:39.490
I'm up against someone like that?

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:42.930
No, no. I never said there's no way for you to win.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.990
It depends on how you go about it.{engrish?}{It'll all depend on how you go about it.}

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:46.450
How I go about it?

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:50.030
For starters, you don't have a proper understanding

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:52.250
of what your own greatest strength is.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:55.930
To be honest, I'd rather take my time teaching it to you,

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:58.350
but we don't have much left, do we?

00:10:58.350 --> 00:11:00.270
You finished resting?

00:11:00.270 --> 00:11:02.760
Huh? Y-Yeah.

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:09.540
A barrier?!

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.660
We're going to do this a little rough.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:28.430
From this point on, there is no holding back.{From this point on, I'm going to come at you without holding back.}

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:52.480
98...

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.990
99...

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:56.800
Just a little more, Mio-sama!

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:58.480
Let's get to one hundred!

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:02.490
Wh-What are you saying?! Jeez!

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:06.700
Onee...

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.690
I can't breathe.

00:12:08.690 --> 00:12:11.430
Don't give up yet.

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.260
Okay, that's enough!

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:28.260
There.

00:12:28.770 --> 00:12:31.270
Good work, everyone!

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:34.770
Here's some magic water, 
perfect for recovering your stamina.

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:36.590
It's nice and cold!

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:39.520
Noel-san, give me one!

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:46.090
Strengthening your basic physical abilities is the most fundamental way of raising your combat skill.

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:50.720
If you raise your baseline well, it's sure to help you out.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:53.660
But that's not enough for me.

00:12:54.310 --> 00:12:57.080
I need to be better at using the Demon Lord's power,

00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:00.180
otherwise I'll be a burden to Basara again.

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:05.500
If you think you can do that overnight, then you're sorely mistaken!

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:09.470
But that man had no problem.

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.510
Ramsus is Ramsus.

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:13.080
You are you.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:17.660
You need to hone your own strengths before you focus on Wilbert's power.

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:19.090
But that's...

00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:21.480
Let's see.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.600
For example...

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:25.280
Huh?

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:30.940
Onee!

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:35.210
M-Mother, why?

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.960
It's fine. It's fine.

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:41.960
Here, everyone.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.960
Say, "ahh."

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:52.970
Huh?

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:54.380
No way.

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:55.530
This is...

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:59.520
Your Master-Servant pact incites a succubus' state of arousal,

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:02.730
so I created a pill to suppress the curse's activation.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:05.570
But I have one warning for you all.

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:06.740
A warning?

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:08.940
As your loyalty increases,

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:12.530
it will grow more difficult for you all to ascertain Basara-kun's position.

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:14.830
You mean...

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:18.500
Ow!

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:21.640
What? What was that sound?

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:25.250
That came from Oldra Forest!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.520
Th-This is...

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:37.160
What happened?

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:40.560
Basara?!

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:44.360
Could you give him some treatment?

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.740
I took it a bit too far when I cornered him.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.570
Are you all right, Basara?

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:04.870
<i>Basara.</i>

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:17.290
I'm...

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:19.140
Hey. You awake now?

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.310
Dad.

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:29.490
We finished treating you, but don't push it.

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:32.660
Dad, I thought I had...

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:33.490
Hey, hey,

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:36.990
you think I'd actually kill my cute little boy?

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:42.160
Well, I was planning on pounding you enough to keep you from moving for a while.

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:44.240
Wh-What the heck?

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:45.920
You said you weren't holding back.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.340
I thought I really was going to die.

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.000
Ow...

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:51.510
Who would tell you that beforehand?

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:55.150
If you don't have an appreciation of gaining the power by risking your own life,

00:15:55.150 --> 00:16:00.520
then you can't really place your life in its hands, now can you?

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:05.300
So, what did you think when you were on the brink of death?

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:06.520
I...

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:18.030
I have to protect everyone with
 my own power, no matter what!

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:23.620
How the hell can I die here?!

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:28.480
That's really all I thought.

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:32.240
Good. And do you remember that move at the end?

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:33.900
Yeah, somewhat.

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:34.550
Good!

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:37.110
Remember that sensation well.

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:39.520
Now, you need to imagine yourself activating that

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:42.030
more consciously on your own, over and over.

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:42.710
Got it?

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:44.590
But that's...

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:46.560
That's just like...

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:48.950
Yeah.

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:51.100
The way it works is pretty close to when you

00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:54.360
lost control of your power and
 caused that tragedy at the village.

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:59.400
It comes from converting your erasure energy into a discharged attack.

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:15.720
Basara!

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:17.090
Basara!

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:19.310
Get a grip, Basara!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:24.200
Take deep breaths. Okay?

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:37.390
I'm fine.

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:39.450
Go on, Dad.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:40.620
I see.

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:45.710
Basara, right now you have three limiters placed on your power.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.120
Three limiters?

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:50.450
A conscious one,

00:17:50.450 --> 00:17:52.180
a subconscious one,

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:57.630
and one based on your hatred of
 Brynhildr for helping cause that incident.

00:17:58.020 --> 00:18:00.390
It's difficult to control the use of a demon sword.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:04.960
If the wielder isn't careful,
 it could influence his mind and consume him.

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:10.710
However, your aversion to that is also placing a limit on Brynhildr's power.

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:16.020
This afternoon you were pushed to the edge,

00:18:16.020 --> 00:18:19.590
and you didn't have time to think
 about your aversion to Brynhildr.

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:22.020
That move is the result of that.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:27.470
In order to match up with Leohart, 
you'll need to release one of those limiters;

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:31.170
two if possible, or you'll be in trouble.

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:34.670
Two, huh?

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.270
Don't get so pessimistic.

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:45.060
This coming battle isn't one
 where you have to beat Leohart.

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:47.700
What do you mean?

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:51.140
Basara, what was your goal in 
coming to the demon realm?

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:53.810
That's obvious. To protect Mio.

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:57.260
However, if you go and win against the reigning Demon Lord faction,

00:18:57.260 --> 00:19:00.520
then the moderate faction will start up their cries again to make Mio-chan

00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:02.370
the next reigning Demon Lord.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:05.020
But if you lose, it'll all be over, too.

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:09.330
You're saying to aim for a draw?

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:10.190
No.

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:12.220
The place where you're looking to settle things

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:15.180
is on a different field from victory or defeat.

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:17.060
Then how am I supposed to?

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:19.340
Don't worry. There's a way.

00:19:20.310 --> 00:19:21.590
Really, Dad?

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:26.320
If it doesn't work out, then I'll cover your back.

00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:28.850
So go cut loose, Basara.

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:32.600
All right, Dad.

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:35.340
On that note,

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:38.410
there's something I need to talk to you about.

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:39.610
There is?

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:41.360
Actually,

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:44.500
it's about your two mothers.

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:45.060
Huh?

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:04.900
<i>Basara...</i>

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:14.940
<i>In order to match up with Leohart, 
you'll need to release one of those limiters;</i>

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:18.770
<i>two if possible, or you'll be in trouble.</i>

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:22.650
<i>If I release them, then I'll...</i>

00:20:29.150 --> 00:20:30.040
<i>I'll...</i>

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:36.170
I'll...

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:08.980
Good morning, Basara-kun!

00:21:08.980 --> 00:21:11.860
What are you up to this early in the morning?

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:12.950
Um,

00:21:13.420 --> 00:21:16.210
I have a few requests.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:34.380
Ramsus-sama and I will join up with you later.

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:37.150
Everyone, please be as careful as possible.

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.220
Leave it to me, Nee-sama!

00:21:39.220 --> 00:21:41.200
I'll be with them!

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:43.320
That's why I'm worried.

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:44.740
